@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki API Use Case
	Testing Koroneiki combined API functionality in a likely use case.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the product consumptions on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	| Liferay Portal Six                  |
	| Liferay Version 7                   |
	| Liferay Version 6                   |
	* I tear down the product consumptions on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Engineering" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	| Liferay Portal Six                  |
	| Liferay Version 7                   |
	| Liferay Version 6                   |
	* I tear down the product consumptions on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	| Liferay Portal Six                  |
	| Liferay Version 7                   |
	| Liferay Version 6                   |
	* I tear down the product consumptions on koroneiki made by the account "Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary" for the following products
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	| Liferay Portal Six                  |
	| Liferay Version 7                   |
	| Liferay Version 6                   |
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Automotive      |
	| Koroneiki Engineering     |
	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| koroneiki.contact3@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| koroneiki.contact4@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	* I tear down the team roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Role  |
	| Optional Account Role |
	* I tear down the contact roles on koroneiki with the following names
	| Default Account Role  |
	| Default Team Role     |
	| Optional Account Role |
	| Optional Team Role    |
	* I tear down the teams on koroneiki with the following names
	| Development Team |
	| Marketing Team   |
	| Engineering Team |
	| Sales Team       |
	* I tear down the products on koroneiki with the following names
	| Liferay Digital Experience Platform |
	| Liferay Portal Six                  |
	| Liferay Version 7                   |
	| Liferay Version 6                   |

Scenario: Entity creation use case
	@ help.center.acceptance = "true"
	@ help.center.smoke = "true"
